<description>&lt;p&gt;Venâncio Mondlane, Mozambique's main opposition leader, is currently on trial for terrorism charges stemming from the 2024 election protests. Islamist militants continue attacks in Cabo Delgado, targeting civilians and complicating humanitarian access, as MSF reports barriers to care in Macomia. The conflict caused 151 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP. The trial and the humanitarian constraints illustrate ongoing political and security tensions in Mozambique.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxQYUhYcmVYOXpVUVE2MWJhY3pkNDEyUkVQM0ItUWNaT2NuelliTi1aMUZqOVN1RnR1M1c5MUlXNDJJNWZkTnNsNnQxSERBRHRGc0ZOdWNmVmVXZURsWERNNGxfMHZ3N0VHT1gyLTF1UGNRci0yY2xaZXVUMVJ2NnlOMS1VenpCZWUtZUo4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Meer | English edition&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxQbzF6d0UxRkpmZmJNZHRUa1d5SERmODZRVXpVX0lBTzZrUU9MZDlwd3Ric1pMZTRYbktKLUZoS3A5bTVGLW1iU2hSV2FhZndlNjVZYWNZeE1RcXplRkVVbS1lRHh2NnctdnoyczN0Q1lUaE93eU9YOFVEa0I3TWg0elQ4eE1NaGJPOTVhTHdoRXRPeUx3bTJ3QXgwS0hYZThjSUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Club of Mozambique&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOekNmWHAzYk5XaGp0ZjlNdEhpc0gtSVczbVRMQ1I2U2lQbHBxRkltcjV5b1JOWTRsS2diTFh5ckltN2ZlRlpnRU9wcHFGdkktM3JVYVBVTE8wYW1GbkNxZ0E3Qkhqd3VmNUttOTNUTUJoaXM5LUtIaEtqY29BZ0h3cHNHa2VBZlVfeS1hTTBwOGdyaFFuOTJXV2xaZEdndm1ldXdGakNLU1I?oc=5&quot;&gt;The EastAfrican&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizAFBVV95cUxQYjhKaGJUYW55Q2pfdGlBMkVONnJfX2N5a3dWcnJMOXZ3dklfcXBqNndkV2xVQXpRVWg0eXNIMW9mbEVkSG9OMXkxbjFuMDhvajNMWTBkenJfVW51MGgzTXM2OEhlRmtiTlU4dFNrcG1XVEE1ZEV5aVpjTVpHa1pCa2dZclBfRmhVRmlRc1J2NjVvbFZ6Z0xyS3RKdHZMSGpIdHBEbGpObzdLdEw0dWhmaTVsN3pEUHhiWlk0dVZDcGVaOV82NUtRM2FiQ2U?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Eastleigh Voice&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.goog